████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████
█                                  Update List    			         		       █
████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████


UPDATED S28:
- Antirecoil: slightly changed the antirecoil of the Re45, Devotion, Devotion Turbo, Spitfire and also slightly adjusted other weapons
- Fixed aim assist behavior, which was not working correctly for some players
- Auto detect mod:
  - One of the biggest issues with the auto detect mod was accessory selection. Many players would fire 1 shot to get the weapon recognized and then select the accessories, which was very inconvenient.
    We made accessory selection MUCH simpler:
    now you can select optic and barrel directly on the default weapon, as soon as you shoot the zen recognizes the weapon and automatically applies the optic and barrel. (works only with assault rifles)
  - Memorizes the last 4 weapons only if they have an accessory selected (previously it memorized any weapon)
- New password system: after choosing the sensitivity a password will be required. Find everything here scriptcronus.it/verify
- 2 touch mod: you no longer need to press twice to reset both weapons, just press once.
- New feature for PS5: pressing right arrow removes the script to make bypass easier (only during the intro)
- New Fire Limit mod: reduces sensitivity when shooting (only in hipfire or always). Option to choose the percentage
- Armor Swap mod improved
- Zipl Jump mod improved
- Keep firing removed
- Edit resp removed from mod settings
- Superglide renamed to mantle boost
- Renamed other mods
- Bug fix: values were occasionally not being saved
- Minor bug fixes

UPDATED S28 (Split 2):
- New mod: Humanize - When enabled, adds timing variance to all mods to create more human-like behavior and reduce detection risk (applied minimally to antirecoil).
- Removed rapid fire from Hemlok
- Fixed antirecoil for Hemlok
- Auto detect: Fixed for Hemlok
- Auto detect: Mastiff now detected as None RF
- Auto detect: Prowler Auto now correctly detected as Prowler. Antirecoil for Prowler Auto will be added in the next update.
- Fixed: Stick drift at 0 was not working properly
- Fixed: Stick drift on Xbox was slightly lowering aim
- Removed: Scrolling text from aim assist mod (freed up memory space)


 

/*				
████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████
█                            BUTTONS AND SETTINGS    					       	   █
████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████*/ 



//put -1 if play with inverted
int inverted = 1

main {
if (CurrentButtonScelta != 7){
//First button for Resync primary/secondary
changeweapon4 = AIM_BTN;
//Second button for Resync primary/secondary
changeweapon5 = MELEE_BTN;

//First button for all menu
 Sbuttonmenu = AIM_BTN;
}

if (CurrentButtonScelta == 7){
//First button for Resync primary/secondary
changeweapon4 = AIM_BTN1;
//Second button for Resync primary/secondary
changeweapon5 = MELEE_BTN1;

//First button for all menu
 Sbuttonmenu = AIM_BTN1;
}}

//Button for put default inside weapons menu   
define resetbutton = PS4_SQUARE;
//Button for enter inside mods
define Crossbuttonmenu = PS4_CROSS;
//Button for exit inside mods
define Circlebuttonmenu = PS4_CIRCLE;

 
//Second button for weapons menu
define Sbuttonweap = PS4_OPTIONS;
//Second button for mod menu
define Sbuttonmod = PS4_PS;
//Second button for turn off the script
define Sbuttonscript = PS4_SHARE;

//Button for mod: Press down
define buttondown = PS4_DOWN;
//Button for mod: Press l3
define buttonl3   = PS4_L3;
//Button for mod: Press left
define buttonleft = PS4_LEFT;

//automatic mod: game rumble, auto detect and auto resync
int automatic_mod = TRUE;


